              "contribution": "Elaborates on the molecular mechanisms of polysaccharide-mediated immunomodulation, including TAM repolarization (M2 to M1), CD8+ T cell exhaustion reversal, and suppression of tumor-intrinsic escape (PD-L1 downregulation). Links these to specific structural motifs (triple helix, acetylation).",
              "facet_id": "F2",
